&nbsp;

About Choreograph: A Leading WPP Media Brand &nbsp;

Choreograph is WPP’s global data products and technology company. We’re on a mission to transform marketing by building the fastest, most connected data platform that bridges marketing strategy to scaled activation.&nbsp;

We work with agencies and clients to transform the value of data by bringing together technology, data and analytics capabilities. We deliver this through the Open Media Studio, an AI-enabled media and data platform for the next era of advertising.&nbsp;

We’re endlessly curious. Our team of thinkers, builders, creators and problem solvers are over 1,000 strong, across 20 markets around the world.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Role Summary and Impact &nbsp;

Ensure the integrity, flow, and visualization of marketing data through the technical implementation of measurement architectures and process automation. Their mission is to transform raw data from various platforms into dynamic reporting ecosystems and high-impact dashboards that facilitate the extraction of insights in real time.

• Implementation Architecture: Execute technical measurement plans, tagging configurations, and conversion pixels.

• ETL &amp; Automation: Maintain data flows to integrate platform signals into data warehouses.

• Strategic Visualization: Develop comprehensive dashboards that enable comparison of multichannel performance.

• Signal Analysis: Process large volumes of data to identify trends, anomalies, and opportunities for optimization.

Skills and Experience &nbsp;

• Professional Background: Engineering (Systems, Industrial, Data), Statistics, or Mathematics.

• Certifications (Preferred): Google Analytics (GA4), cloud certifications (GCP/AWS), or visualization tools.

• Advanced proficiency in SQL, Python, and cloud environments.

• In-depth knowledge of GT4, GTM, and ad-tech platforms.

• High level of proficiency with dashboarding tools: Looker Studio, PBI.

• Extreme attention to detail and ability to work in a team using agile methodologies.

